Subject: [PATCH] models/tts.py: fix NameError on Tts.verify() fallback path

Same bug as models/nmt.py: Tts.verify() calls check_output() and
time.time()/time.sleep() when the bhashini_models health check fails,
but neither subprocess.check_output nor the time module is imported.
Add the same two imports models/asr.py already has for the identical
verify()/update() pattern.
---
 python/pocketinfer/models/tts.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/python/pocketinfer/models/tts.py b/python/pocketinfer/models/tts.py
index ebc2be8..83f989b 100644
--- a/python/pocketinfer/models/tts.py
+++ b/python/pocketinfer/models/tts.py
@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@
 import requests
+import time
+from subprocess import check_output
 
 
 class Tts:
